Subject: [PATCH] feat: F-011 goblin-start quest-item spell scripts (5 credit
 spells)

- KTC Snapflash photographs target -> credit its entry
- Monkey Business / Weed Whacker / Cluster Cluck / Zombies-Booster fixed credit

